1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,559
Once you've left your home,

2
00:00:01,559 --> 00:00:03,119
returning for something forgotten brings

3
00:00:03,119 --> 00:00:04,679
terrible luck. The threshold remembers

4
00:00:04,679 --> 00:00:06,239
your departure, and crossing it

5
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:07,799
twice confuses your fate. If

6
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:09,359
you must go back, look

7
00:00:09,359 --> 00:00:10,919
into a mirror before leaving

8
00:00:10,919 --> 00:00:12,479
again—it resets your journey. Soldiers

9
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:14,039
especially fear this omen, knowing

10
00:00:14,039 --> 00:00:15,599
that a forgotten wallet might

11
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:17,159
cost more than money. Better

12
00:00:17,159 --> 00:00:18,719
to manage without it.
